			<item>
				<title>About</title>
				<link>http://localhost:1313/about/</link>
				<pubDate>Tue, 07 Jul 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
				<guid>http://localhost:1313/about/</guid>
				<description>&lt;p&gt;I am a Brazilian Web Application Penetration Tester with a background in Computer Engineering and a strong interest in offensive security.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;My work focuses on evaluating the security of modern web applications through structured, manual testing methodologies. Rather than relying solely on automated scanners, I prioritize understanding how applications are designed, how users interact with them, and how attackers can abuse those interactions.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Over the years, I have performed security assessments covering authentication, authorization, session management, business logic, API security, input validation, file upload, client-side behavior and other areas commonly found in modern web environments.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
